Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why do tires
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.65,0:00:01.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,explode on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:01.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,the highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.95,0:00:02.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Most blowouts start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,days earlier, with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:04.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,a tire that's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:04.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,just a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:05.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,little low.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:06.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every time it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,rolls, the soft
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,sidewall bends flat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:09.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:10.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,then springs back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.59,0:00:11.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,At sixty miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour, that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,happens fifteen times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:14.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:15.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,All that bending
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,turns into heat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,deep inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.53,0:00:18.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,the rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:19.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The heat slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:19.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,cooks the glue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,that holds the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel belts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:22.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Until the tread
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:23.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,peels away, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:24.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,the tire bursts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:24.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:25.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,split second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:26.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,And tires quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,lose about a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:28.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,pound of air
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:29.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.29,0:00:29.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's where those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:30.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,shreds of rubber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:31.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,on the highway
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:31.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,come from.
